- Lane barriers: every lane now has one road block. The first car through smashes it, the next one ends the level
- Levels are longer and run in waves: WAVE 1, WAVE 2 and a FINAL WAVE, with lulls between
- Supercharge now takes 5 cars in a row; the BOMB booster takes 10 kills
- A bomb dropped anywhere in a lane counts, even while the last shot is still flying
